# Demo: ENERGY + FLIGHTLOG + VPMS + TRAFFIC. 60 drones per hour, 10 minutes measured,
# prediction error 10 %, shared arcs (case C1, first-come-first-served). No wind.
00:00:00.00>PLUGINS LOAD ENERGY
00:00:00.00>PLUGINS LOAD FLIGHTLOG
00:00:00.00>PLUGINS LOAD VPMS
00:00:00.00>PLUGINS LOAD TRAFFIC
00:00:00.00>VPMS SHARED
00:00:00.00>VPMS SHOW
00:00:00.00>FLIGHTLOG demo TRACE
00:00:00.00>PAN 52.0 4.0
00:00:00.00>ZOOM 40
00:00:00.00>TRAFFIC 60 1 10 BASE 0 600
